# title: Ask the QNX headers for the full API
# file: open62541.h
# upstream: include/open62541/config.h.in
# test: build (no implicit function declaration)
#
# The header defines _XOPEN_SOURCE 600 before the first system header. The
# QNX headers then hide what is not part of that standard, among it functions
# that the POSIX event loop calls. _QNX_SOURCE makes them visible again; it is
# what QNX assumes when no feature test macro is defined at all.
#
@@ hunk
